OL,3,AUK government to make Jackdaw gas field
OL,4,Aannouncement
OL,5,
OL,6,FMultiple Whitehall sources have told
OL,7,FBBC News the government would make an
OL,8,Fannouncement on Jackdaw on Wednesday
OL,9,Fmorning with the Energy Secretary
OL,10,FMiatta Fahnbulleh expected to address
OL,11,FMPs in the afternoon.
